    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Lone Grove</strong></h2>The Lone Grove is a short experience, about a boy who, after the death of his father, discovers in his belongings records of a forest where his father used to camp. He decides to go to the place to try to connect with the memories of the father with whom he never had a very good relationship. There he will find memories, records and mysteries to solve.<br><br>It's a game about exploration, memories, puzzles and a beautiful place see.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Vast Scenery:</h2></strong><br>Explore a big scenario carefully constructed with a lot of interesting points and mysteries do find.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong></h2>Figure it out how to solve all puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive The Night:</strong></h2>Stay in the light, collect resources and be careful.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find memories:</strong></h2>Keep an eye open for collectables, they may hold answers to mysteries.",
